  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful\nوَالضُّحٰىۙ‏(1)\nWAZ ZOHAA.\n(O’ Our Apostle Muhammad!) By the Noonday (Radiation) (Brightness)\nوَالَّيْلِ اِذَا سَجٰىۙ‏(2)\nWAL LAYLE EZAA SAJAA.\nBy the Night when it darkeneth!\nمَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلٰىؕ‏(3)\nMAA WADDA-A’KA RABBOKA WA MAA QALAA.\nHath forsaken not thee thy Lord, nor hath He been displeased (with thee)!\nوَلَلْاٰخِرَةُ خَيْرٌ لَّكَ مِنَ الْاُوْلٰىؕ‏(4)\nWA LAL-AAKHERATO KHAYRUL LAKA MENAL OOLAA.\nAnd verily the end is better for thee than the beginning (of life)!\nوَلَسَوْفَ يُعْطِيْكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرْضٰىؕ‏(5)\nWA LA-SAWFA YOA’TEEKA RABBOKA FA-TARZAA.\nAnd soon will give thee thy Lord that thou shalt be well pleased!\nاَلَمْ يَجِدْكَ يَتِيْمًا فَاٰوٰى‏(6)\nALAM YAJIDKA YATEEMAN FA-AAWAA.\nWhat! Found He not thee an orphan, and sheltered (thee)?\nوَوَجَدَكَ ضَآ لًّا فَهَدٰى‏(7)\nWA WAJADAKA ZAAAL-LAN FA-HADAA.\nAnd (He) found thee in loss (and immediately) guided thee\nوَوَجَدَكَ عَآئِلًا فَاَغْنٰىؕ‏(8)\nWA WAJADAKA A’AAELAN FA-AGHNAA.\nAnd (He) found thee in need, and (immediately) made thee independent\nفَاَمَّا الْيَتِيْمَ فَلَا تَقْهَرْؕ‏(9)\nFA-AMMAL YATEEMA FALAA TAQHAR.\nSo, unto an orphan, oppress not!\nوَاَمَّا السَّآئِلَ فَلَا تَنْهَرْؕ‏(10)\nWA AMMAS SAAA-ELA FALAA TANHAR.\nAnd as to the beggar, chide him not!\nوَاَمَّا بِنِعْمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثْ‏(11)\nWA AMMAA BE-NE’MATE RABBEKA FA-HADDIS.\nAnd as to the bounties of thy Lord, thou announce (them unto others)",
